ScreenAtlas's map navigation and local review workflow derive from the 3D Rep
Screen Atlas developed by Kinesis Labs, supplied for this standalone extraction
by Max Malouf. Reference checkpoint: 97ba644778a6b3a0d16a8f889038eb62851a11c4.

The standalone implementation preserves and extends that workflow under the
MIT license. Original application artwork, native applications, services,
private review databases, and repository history are not included.

The Second Sole showcase combines user-supplied design references and
AI-generated derivatives/extensions created for this project with Codex's
built-in Image Gen tool. Exact prompts and input/output digests are bundled.
These are illustrative designs, not captures from a working marketplace or
recorded human review decisions. Third-party sneaker names and marks remain
with their respective owners; no affiliation or endorsement is implied.

